        <mxCell id="cmd0ZATRMR-j2Ud92fbf-28" parent="1dijiySgXApiauiCDTFy-4" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=default;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;spacingLeft=6;dashed=1;container=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Footer&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Navigation&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Should be stuck to the bottom of the page. Should appear and disappear when user scrolls to and from bottom of page. Appears on all sub-pages of the website. Contain less common links like &lt;u&gt;Github&lt;/u&gt;, &lt;u&gt;Home&lt;/u&gt;, &lt;u&gt;Resume&lt;/u&gt;. Possibly have contact info on right-hand side.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
